title    Lanternfly Hop
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Climbing Gym (level6) option (#456): a cartoon chase in E-flat major at 176. A xylophone hook hops up the chord with a chromatic hiccup before each top note, like a spotted lanternfly jumping, over an oom-pah FM bass, offbeat marimba chords and a woodblock. The last eight bars lift a tone, to F major. Layers: hook, bass, marimba and block from the start, then bigkick, clap and hats at 2x, a glockenspiel an octave over the hook at 3x, sixteenth hats and synth-brass on the offbeats at FRENZY.
tempo    176
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.2

# untagged voices are the base layer, the hook among them (layers only add); the intro plays every layer
voice lead   xylophone vol=1.14
voice mar    marimba   vol=0.53 pan=-0.3 center=G4 gate=0.6
voice bass   fmbass    vol=0.72  gate=0.5
voice block  block     vol=0.41 pan=0.4
voice hit    orchhit   vol=0.48
voice rise   riser     vol=0.31
voice kick   bigkick   vol=0.53 layer=drums
voice clap   clap909   vol=0.55 pan=-0.1 layer=drums
voice hat    hat909    vol=0.31 pan=0.35 layer=drums
voice crash  crash     vol=0.31 pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice glock  glock     vol=0.36  pan=0.25 oct=1 layer=lead
voice fhat   hat909    vol=0.24  pan=-0.35 layer=frenzy
voice brass  synbrass  vol=0.29 pan=0.3 center=G4 gate=0.5 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
lead  | Bb4 . . . Bb4 . . . Bb4 . Bb4 . Bb4 Bb4 Bb4 Bb4 | .--- .--- .--- F5 G5 A5 Bb5 |
block | x... x... x.x. xxxx | x... x... x.x. xxxx |
hit   | [Bb7]!--- .--- [Bb7]!--- .--- | [Bb7]!--- [Bb7]!--- [Bb7]!------- |
bass  | Bb2--- .--- Bb2--- .--- | Bb2--- Bb2--- Bb2------- |
rise  | _ | Bb5--------------- |
kick  | X... .... X... .... | X... X... X.X. XXXX |

